---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { orderTerms } from '../ordering.mjs';
---
<Layout title="Samples, Payment & Delivery | Welltroy" description="Plan your packaging order: sample choices, 30% deposit and 70% balance by T/T, specifications, shipping and quality queries." canonicalPath="/ordering/">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Ordering &amp; delivery</div><p class="eyebrow">Buying from Welltroy</p><h1>A Clear Path to Your Packaging Order</h1><p class="lead">Start with the product and destination. Confirm the specification, sample route, payment milestones and delivery terms in writing before production.</p><div class="anchor-links"><a href="#samples">Samples</a><a href="#payment">Payment</a><a href="#delivery">Delivery</a><a href="#quality">Quality queries</a></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container policy-content">
    <h2 id="samples">Choose Your Sample Route</h2><div class="grid-2"><article class="editorial-card"><h3>Existing product sample</h3><p>Useful for checking the available material, construction, closure and approximate size. Tell us which product you would like to assess.</p></article><article class="editorial-card"><h3>Custom printed sample</h3><p>Useful for reviewing your artwork and specification. Send your logo, size, colors and material requirements so we can confirm the sample route.</p></article></div><p>{orderTerms.sample}</p><p><strong>Before dispatch:</strong> confirm which sample is included, any artwork or setup requirements, and who pays the courier charge. A free sample does not automatically mean free delivery.</p>
    <p>Before approving a custom sample, use the <a href="/guides/custom-mailer-sample-approval/">mailer sample approval checklist</a> to record fit, artwork, closure and the final reference.</p>
    <h2 id="payment">30% Deposit · 70% Balance</h2><p>{orderTerms.payment}</p><p>Your quotation should identify the invoicing company, currency, total amount, payment milestones and bank beneficiary. Verify payment details with your established Welltroy contact before transferring funds, especially if any account details change.</p>
    <h2>Approve the Specification</h2><ul class="check-list"><li>Product model, dimensions and usable space</li><li>Material, thickness or paper weight and closure</li><li>Artwork, printing colors and approval reference</li><li>Quantity per design, packing and carton information</li><li>Inspection requirements and agreed acceptance criteria</li></ul><p>Need a particular test report, food-contact document or environmental specification? Include the exact product, intended use and destination market in your enquiry.</p>
    <h2 id="delivery">Production and Delivery Are Separate</h2><p>{orderTerms.production}</p><p>For a delivery quotation, include your country, postcode or port and required arrival date. Ask us to specify the available shipping method, dispatch estimate, transit estimate and whether the price includes freight, import duties and taxes. Arrival timing depends on the route and customs clearance.</p>
    <h2 id="quality">Raise a Quality Query</h2><p>Email <a href="mailto:info@welltroy.com">info@welltroy.com</a> with your order reference, affected quantity, photos or video, and the agreed specification. Keep the affected goods and packaging available for review. For transit damage, include photos of the outer cartons and shipping labels.</p><p>Confirm inspection arrangements, reporting deadlines and remedies in your written order terms before ordering. Custom orders are reviewed against their agreed specification.</p>
    <p>After receiving a proposal, use the <a href="/guides/compare-custom-mailer-quotes/">custom mailer quote comparison worksheet</a> to confirm specification, cost items and delivery scope.</p>
    <h2>Your Enquiry, Then Your Quotation</h2><p>Submitting the website form requests a quotation; it does not place an order or take payment. We reply using the email address you provide. Include any deadline in your message, or contact us on WhatsApp for a time-sensitive request.</p><div class="button-row"><a class="button" href="/quote/#quote-form">Prepare an enquiry</a><a class="text-link" href="/catalogue/">View the current product guide →</a></div>
  </div></section>
</Layout>
